// STONEMILES — cab-first truck navigation for a semi driver, by Stonervision.
//
// Live data (all keyless, fetched client-side — see DATA-PLAN.md):
//   - Map: MapLibre GL JS vector tiles (OpenFreeMap / OpenStreetMap
//     data) via client/src/mapEngine.ts — native bearing/pitch, 3D
//     buildings; satellite base is Esri World Imagery raster
//   - Search / state detection: Nominatim first, Photon fuzzy fallback on a miss
//   - Truck routing (up to 3 options): Valhalla demo server, costing "truck"
//   - Speed limits, restrictions, weigh stations, fuel stops: Overpass API
//   - Weather along route: Open-Meteo
//   - Route weather (2026-11-01): corridor Open-Meteo + NWS alerts +
//     NWS NEXRAD radar tiles via Iowa State Mesonet (routeWeather.ts)
// Server actions own only the driver's records: truck profile, trip sheets,
// saved loads, and the Ask Meca assistant (which answers from a snapshot of
// this app's real state).

